-- â€¢ Mapping enum/huruf â†’ nama penuh via PetMutationRegistry (Nightmare = "A" aman)
-- â€¢ Auto equip/unequip Cleansing Shard
-- â€¢ Scan world models milik player sendiri
-- â€¢ Rate limit ApplyShard

